{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mixed_parameter_cellwise",
  "authors": [
   "EarthSciAST test suite"
  ],
  "description": "mix(p) reads p in a value position and whole, as the operand of a sum over c: p is a mixed parameter. y1 applies mix to the state u (over [c]) elementwise, so the lift re-points the reference to mix's cellwise variant mix.cellwise1, which binds p to u whole and its fresh parameter p_cell to u read at the cell. outer(a) passes a to mix, so a is mixed too, and outer.cellwise1 references mix.cellwise1 in its body. u is a state so the sum is evaluated at run time."
 },
